Bind Npc 24202 Zone 1 for karus rogue
Bind Npc 14202 Zone 2 for elmorad rogue
Quest 347 "72Lv skill"
    Journal for karus "I've decided to undergo the test to learn the hidden skills of [Secret Agent] Clarence."
    Journal for elmorad "I've decided to undergo the test to learn the hidden skills of [Secret Agent] Clarence."
    Collect 7 of 810369000

Requires player level >= 72

Rewards none

On offer
    Say "You are qualified to learn and use Level 72 skills."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "To learn lv.72 skill, you need 7 [Spell Stone Powder]. Are you ready to learn the ultimate skill?"

On in_progress
    Say "To complete the lv.72 rogue skilll, you need 7 [Spell Stone Powder]."

On ready
    If player is karus
        Say "Master, you've collected all the items needed to master rogue Level 72 skills. Hurry back to [Secret Agent] Clarence."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Master, you've collected all the items needed to master rogue Level 72. Hurry back to [Secret Agent] Clarence."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "This is Blow Arrow and Blinding, rogue Level 72 skills. Your power will be the hope of us rogues."
